			"notes": "\\## 0.1.5\n\n\n\n\\### 中文\n\n\n\n回放格式升级到 \\*\\*v6\\*\\*。\n\n\n\n修复：\n\n\\- 修复了光标显示，现在可以自定义光标的样式和大小（未自定义时，默认与系统光标保持一致）\n\n\n\n已知问题：\n\n\\- 快捷栏异常\n\n\n\n\\---\n\n适配 Minecraft 1.21.1 / Fabric\n\n\n\n\\### English\n\n\n\nReplay format upgraded to \\*\\*v6\\*\\*.\n\n\n\nFixes:\n\n\\- Fixed cursor rendering; the cursor style and size are now customizable (when unconfigured, it matches your system cursor by default)\n\n\n\nKnown issues:\n\n\\- The hotbar behaves abnormally\n\n\n\n\\---\n\nSupports Minecraft 1.21.1 / Fabric"
		},
